WEBVTT

00:15:56.436 --> 00:16:00.236
or achieving my professional goals.

00:16:00.276 --> 00:16:06.356
It came from an understanding
of where I came from and my heritage

00:16:06.396 --> 00:16:11.236
and these kind of deeper
aspects of my identity.

00:16:11.916 --> 00:16:13.076
So along the way,

00:16:13.116 --> 00:16:17.356
I started a social enterprise
called This Same Sky.

00:16:17.396 --> 00:16:21.876
And we now work with multi-generational
artisans in India and Africa,

00:16:21.876 --> 00:16:24.956
we provide them
with a dignified livelihood.

00:16:24.996 --> 00:16:29.036
And we create accessories
that help all of us kind of celebrate

00:16:29.036 --> 00:16:33.156
the ways that our identities
are unique and meaningful